  // ── Reef science lab: three investigations (sciLab) ──────────────────────
  // Each investigation runs on the tool's own rules, so its numbers agree with
  // the rest of the lab:
  //   A. One heatwave, week by week: dhwFor and alertLevel (NOAA Coral Reef
  //      Watch), bleachedShare and heatMortality (the Reef future curves).
  //   B. A carbonate budget: acidFactor plus published Caribbean rates.
  //   C. Seaweed versus grazers: the Reef future model's own yearly rule with no
  //      heatwaves, with grazing as a dial instead of three levels.
  var SCILAB_WEEKS = 52;       // one year, week by week
